# Zinc documentation

- Treat `user-manual/chinese/` as the source of truth for the user manual.
- Do not alter code samples, type names, or API paths unless the Chinese source changes too.
- Keep one language per PR. Link the tracking issue.
- Follow the glossary and filename table in `AGENTS.md`.
